  "notes": "L-bracket for a 37 mm (37D) gearmotor. The motor's gearbox face sits on top of the plate (z=3) with its shaft going DOWN through the 12.5 mm boss hole; six M3 screws on the 31 mm circle hold it. Place dc-gearmotor-12v-37 at (2, 4.5, 3) so its centre (18.5, 18.5) is on the boss hole. The wall (y 0-3, 40 mm tall) bolts to a chassis with two M3 screws (foot1/foot2 point along Y at z=20). Holes m1-m6 and boss are on the bottom face.",
